{"timestamp":"2026-11-16T21:02:26.055Z","ordinal":9,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_80000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000089","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Do exactly these steps in order, and do not add steps.\n1. Use multi_agent_v1__spawn_agent with agent_type worker to start one worker agent. In its message, ask it to use apply_patch once to add the new file sentinel/child-checked.txt with the single line: checked, not to retry the call, and to reply with one line: the check id that a seamark post-edit message named after the call, or the single word none when no such message came.\n2. Wait for the agent with multi_agent_v1__wait_agent, then close it with multi_agent_v1__close_agent.\nDo not use apply_patch yourself. Then reply with the one line that the worker replied."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000015","create_time":1794862946.055773,"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"content_item_metadata":[{"provenance":{"type":"user"}}]}},"metadata":{"history_sequence":5,"sampled_through_sequence":0,"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_80000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000089","turn_id":"20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000015","role":"user"},"revision":"retained_30000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000044","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":0,"mcp_attribution":{"status":"none"}}}
